"edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11010-ersito","name":"erSito","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11010_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-18T06:15:31-08:00","id":1474895,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>erSito</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1473913-chronicles-hosted-in-da-london#post1473913\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hi there!<br /> I'm looking for an adventure module (official o unofficial) that takes place in the Black Plague London (1348) or soon after that. Stories that can easily be adapted to happen there are also welcome. Any suggestions?<br /> <br /> Thank you!!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Not quite the same year or even century, but if memory tricks me not, <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Giovanni_Chronicles_II:_Blood_%26_Fire\" target=\"_blank\">Blood &amp; Fire</a> is at least partly set in 1666 London, one of the years of its <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Second_plague_pandemic\" target=\"_blank\">ressurgence</a> in the city. Also of potential interest perhaps, would be <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Giovanni_Chronicles_III:_The_Sun_Has_Set\" target=\"_blank\">its sequel</a>, that passes at least in part in 1848 London, a turbulent period for the whole of Europe that might serve as a base framework for a game set during the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peasants%27_Revolt\" target=\"_blank\">Peasant's Revolt</a> of Wat Tyler, i guess. Among other things.<br /> <br /> Hope it helps or at least entertains.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 02-22-2022, 08:56 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-18T23:58:29-08:00","id":1500085,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JezMiller</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1473913-chronicles-hosted-in-da-london?p=1474387#post1474387\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm working on an SV setting for Winchester 1396, so I've done some research into England in that period, but I don't have a module set in London itself. I can offer a few suggestions</div> </div> </div> </div>And I finally published it. There was a lovely review posted a few days ago <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/415978/The-Peasants-Revolt?src=newest_community&amp;filters=45622_45629\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.storytellersvault.com/pr...rs=45622_45629</a><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\